{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/40b50259199409954029b2bfbbe3cbe5.poster.avif?t=1760701881\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/40b50259199409954029b2bfbbe3cbe5.webm?t=1760701881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/40b50259199409954029b2bfbbe3cbe5.mp4?t=1760701881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Winter. A remote forest. Strange people.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work at a pickup point, handing out orders to visitors. But things aren\u2019t as simple as they seem \u2014 you can\u2019t shake the feeling that someone is watching you. Will you uncover who\u2026 or <i>what</i> it is?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand over the orders.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to receive and deliver packages to the customers who come to your pickup point. But don\u2019t forget to watch your sanity \u2014 lose it, and something truly terrifying might happen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re not alone\u2026 or is this just a dream?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sense eyes on you from the darkness outside. Could it be real\u2026 or only your imagination?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036290?t=1760701881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/7646347c04666778e6ddd1193cbc7347e93c4a67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760701881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/cc486d9a06481ca44e9fd04a90f1c0c4882d57dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760701881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai